## Why This Is Asked

Testing feature-flag gated workflows ensures comprehensive coverage of user journeys across different configurations and prevents onboarding experience regressions when toggling between variants.

## Key Concepts

- Feature flag management and deterministic mocking
- End-to-end test isolation and data seeding strategies
- State persistence validation across browser refresh cycles
- API mocking for controlled test scenarios

## Code Example

```javascript
// Cypress implementation example
describe('Feature-Flag Gated Onboarding Flow', () => {
  beforeEach(() => {
    cy.task('seedTestData', { userId: 'test-user-123' });
    cy.intercept('GET', '/api/admin/flags*', { body: { onboardingEnabled: true } });
  });

  it('displays multi-step onboarding when flag is enabled', () => {
    cy.login('test-user-123');
    cy.get('[data-testid="onboarding-step-1"]').should('be.visible');
    cy.reload();
    cy.get('[data-testid="onboarding-step-1"]').should('be.visible');
  });

  afterEach(() => {
    cy.task('cleanupTestData', { userId: 'test-user-123' });
  });
});
```

